  "solution": {
    "brief": "Wasp example 18: field-driven series continued",
    "principle": "\n\nRelated insight: Related insight: Tutorial 19 (wasp_19) directly continues the field-driven series from tutorial 18, further developing field-driven aggregation with scalar-field biased-growth, voxel-based techniques, and parametric-assembly strategies. Tutorial 18 is a direct prerequisite for tutorial 19, and the two share closely related content around field-driven discrete assembly with isoline, attribute-based, and 3d-populate workflows.\n\nRelated insight: Related insight: Tutorial 20 (wasp_20) continues the field-driven series beyond tutorial 19, confirming the series extends through at least tutorial 20. Tutorial 18 is an indirect prerequisite for tutorial 20 via tutorial 19.\n\nRelated insight: Related insight: Tutorial 21 (wasp_21) continues beyond tutorial 20 into a new topic series, confirming the field-driven series concludes at tutorial 20. Tutorial 18 is an indirect prerequisite for tutorial 21 via tutorials 19 and 20.\n\nRelated insight: Related insight: Tutorial 23 (wasp_23) continues the new topic series beyond tutorial 22, further confirming the field-driven series concludes at tutorial 20. Tutorial 18 is an indirect prerequisite for tutorial 23 via tutorials 19, 20, 21, 22.\n\nRelated insight: \n\nRelated insight: Tutorial 24 (wasp_24) continues the new topic series beyond tutorial 23, further confirming the field-driven series concludes at tutorial 20. Tutorial 18 is an indirect prerequisite for tutorial 24 via tutorials 19, 20, 21, 22, and 23.",
